"Chemical Engineer","Environmental Engineer","Sustainability/Decarbonisation Specialist"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This gives the graduate multiple pathways across industrial environmental engineering, water treatment, EHS, environmental consulting, sustainability, ESG, carbon management and clean-technology sectors, rather than limiting the career to conventional environmental compliance."}]}]}